; ..\_01_BSW\Gen\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   664                      The API call is forwarded using a function pointer which is read using ComStackLib macros.
; ..\_01_BSW\Gen\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   665                      
; ..\_01_BSW\Gen\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   666      \COUNTERMEASURE \N The function pointer is read using the passed Id (and ComStackLib macros). 
