; ..\_01_BSW\Gen\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   668                         It is checked at runtime if it is in the valid range.
; ..\_01_BSW\Gen\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   669                         The pointer is provided by the lower layer and is assumed to be valid. It is passed as is to the corresponding function. 
; ..\_01_BSW\Gen\GenData\PduR_Lcfg.c	   670  
